SUMMARY:Online Info Session: MASc and PhD in CivMin
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, November 16\n6 – 7 p.m. (ET)\n👉REGISTER HERE to join the event  \nExplore whether a Master of Applied Science (MASc) or Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) degree in Civil & Mineral Engineering is the right program for you! \nJoin Associate Chair Daniel Posen to learn more about our research program options\, research themes\, how to put your best application forward\, and what to expect throughout both the application process and the degree itself in CivMin. \nThe presentation will be followed by a Q & A session with Professor Posen and our Admissions & Recruitment Coordinator Pauline Martini.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/online-info-session-masc-and-phd-in-civmin-2/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
END:VEVENT
