SUMMARY:Vancouver\, BC: Alumni meet-up
DESCRIPTION:Attention U of T Engineering alumni in the Vancouver area! \nJoin Dean Chris Yip (ChemE 8T8) and fellow alumni from across the Vancouver region to catch up with old friends\, make new connections and hear about the exciting work happening across the U of T Engineering community.  \nWhether you’re a recent graduate or it’s been years since your days on campus\, this is a wonderful opportunity to meet fellow engineers\, share experiences and expand your network.    \nEvent Details:\nDate: Tuesday\, November 17\, 2026\nTime: 6:00pm – 8:00 pm\nLocation: The Sequel\, Theatre Room\, 1575 W Georgia Street\, Vancouver BC V6G 2T1\nEnjoy complimentary refreshments   \n Register now! \nQuestions? \nEmail events@engineering.utoronto.ca  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiscover your Global Alumni Ambassadors (GAA) around the world—visit our GAA site for more details!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/vancouver-bc-alumni-meet-up/
LOCATION:The Sequel\, Theatre Room\, 1575 W Georgia Street\, Vancouver BC V6G 2T1
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
